## Oregons proposed DCAMA can serve as one example of what citizen legislation might look like. Other states may need different versions. Rural counties may need different protections than urban regions. Water-scarce areas may need stronger water provisions. Grid-constrained regions may need deeper energy analysis. Communities near agricultural land may need farmland protections. Areas with wildfire risk, flood risk, seismic risk, or limited emergency services may need specialized safeguards.

The point is not that one bill can solve every problem everywhere.

